## Python IDEs & Tools

| Tool | Best For | Cost |
|------|----------|------|
| **VS Code** | General development, extensions | Free |
| **PyCharm** | Professional Python development | Free / Paid |
| **Jupyter Notebook** | Data science, interactive coding | Free |
| **IDLE** | Quick scripts, comes with Python | Free |

### Recommended Setup for This Course:
1. **VS Code** with the Python extension
2. Or **Jupyter Notebooks** for interactive exercises

```bash
# Install VS Code Python extension
code --install-extension ms-python.python

# Or install Jupyter
pip install jupyter
jupyter notebook
```

