## Course Roadmap

We will cover **10 topics** in this course:

1. **Getting Started** -- installing Python, first program (this topic!)
2. **Variables & Data Types** -- storing and typing data
3. **Operators & Expressions** -- arithmetic, logic, comparisons
4. **Control Flow** -- if/elif/else, decision making
5. **Loops** -- for, while, iteration patterns
6. **Functions** -- defining, calling, parameters, returns
7. **Data Structures** -- lists, tuples, dicts, sets
8. **File I/O** -- reading, writing, CSV, JSON
9. **Error Handling** -- try/except, custom exceptions
10. **Modules & Packages** -- imports, pip, virtual environments

Each topic includes **slides**, **interactive notebooks**, and **hands-on labs**.

